<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECHS NAME TEAM TO FACE INDIA.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECHS NAME TEAM TO FACE INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petr Korda, Bohdan Ulihrach, Jiri Novak and Martin Damm have been chosen by Czech Davis Cup team captain Vladimir Savrda to face India in the first round of the 1997 world group.</p>
<p>Korda, who last year helped power the Czechs to the semifinals, where they lost to Sweden, looks in strong form</p>
</text>
